278	     ink-colored box to follow the theme (same technique as the start page).
279	     168px at 156px, starting 794px from the left edge of the name. */
280	  .about-portrait {
281	    position: absolute;
282	    top: 0;
283	    left: 5.09em;
284	    width: 1.077em;
285	    height: 1.077em;
